{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_lmlee_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_lmlee_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"三餐一日","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lmlee_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"03114d6a75d783e8e2346752580a57a1ee0a730150a8cc1bbf0efd99f4ae7a94","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"剛開始，老鯉只是想去那片菜市場逛一逛，沒想到一逛就是十幾年。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您在這菜市場來來回回轉了快有好幾圈了，是沒有找到需要的食材嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，菜市場就要關門了，您再不走，就得在裡面過夜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這才不到七點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，一看您就不是本地人，這裡晚上亂得很，誰有膽子開門到那個時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我確實是剛來沒幾天，昨天才在附近的旅館住下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門那麼多地方可去，先生怎麼想著要來逛一逛這小小的菜市場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我的一個小習慣，每到一個新地方，就會去看看當地的菜市場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風俗、人情、土宜，都能在這裡體現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"菜市場而已，哪會有什麼不一樣？不過是人來人往，吵吵鬧鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就比如......尚蜀的菜市場能徹夜不打烊，這裡就不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生您還要不要買菜了？不買我就收攤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼推薦的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"小暑節氣，天氣炎熱，不如買兩支茭白筍回家煲粥，解熱防暑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，還是不打擾了，旅館裡的冰箱不大，放不下這半米長的茭白筍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......真是個怪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"耽誤我回家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，你今天走得是不是有些早啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘖，這混帳羔子......這麼早走都避不開。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的錢準備好了沒有？連帶著上個月拖欠的，一併給了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這幾個月生意不景氣，實在是剩不下什麼孝敬給您的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不正好，趕緊滾蛋，把攤子給有能力的人經營。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，你做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"放手，別砸了，別砸了！再寬限些時日吧，到時我一定籌到錢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，晚了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"慢著，小兄弟高抬貴手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，大爺你誰啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，太抬舉了，你我以兄弟相稱就足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你給我放尊重點，也不打聽打聽我上面是哪位人物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是位姓林的貴人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然知道，還不識相點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好傢伙，怎麼這城裡遇上的混混十個裡有八個都說自己是林先生的手下。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，怪不得我覺得這位小兄弟面熟，想來在林先生的宅子裡見過面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......見、見過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，去年林先生家裡的金桂開得正好，所以做了許多糖桂花。不知道小兄弟你收到沒有啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當、當然，臨走前林先生送了我十多罐，根本吃不完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等等......我記錯了，林先生家種的好像不是桂花，是桃樹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*龍門粗口*，你到底認不認識林先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不一定認識，但你一定不認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊滾吧，聽說那位林先生治下頗嚴，要是知道有人冒用他的名號作惡，恐怕那人會吃不了兜著走啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市井混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，晦氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......先生，謝謝您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是動動嘴皮子的事情，不必介懷。下次遇上這種小人，不用害怕，多半是借勢欺人的混混，真正的黑幫哪有這麼不上道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......我就是個小販，哪裡有什麼識人的本事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，先生，您先別走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"旅館裡的冰箱雖小，但這一袋荔枝應該還是放得下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"家裡種的，值不了幾個錢，就是片心意，先生就帶回去吃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我在想，就是為幾顆荔枝的好滋味，走上這麼遠的路也算是值得了。多謝了，老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，先生您喜歡就好，有空記得常來光顧小攤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定一定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生，嘿，鯉先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，蔡老闆，我還沒到菜市場，就聽到你在喊我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我這不是怕留給你的這幾棵冬筍不新鮮了嘛。大寒時節，正是吃冬筍的好時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼幾分鐘的時間，哪會壞得那麼快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"帶回去記得泡鹽水啊，這樣存得久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，我租的房子廚房只有那麼一點點大，放進保鮮袋丟冰箱就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這可是上好的白眼筍，你是個講究人我才留給你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，過兩天我要請一位貴客到屋子裡坐坐，存不久的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生你在龍門交到朋友了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不算朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那要怎樣才能算鯉先生的朋友呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生今天來幫太太買菜啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我太太沒有那麼挑剔，不會因為幾棵筍，就讓我跑到離家十幾公里外的菜市場買菜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"（鯉先生，這、這位不是......不是那位......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你就當他是個普通過路人就行了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生還沒有回答我的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我就是個市井俗人，誰在大酒樓設宴請我吃一頓，我定把他奉為知己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"手下報給我的可不一樣。你這一周，出入的盡是街道巷陌的小館子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生你知道那麼多我會出現的場所，為什麼偏偏來這離家十幾公里的菜市場尋我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"為了幾棵筍不值得跑十幾公里，但為了謝個朋友，還是值得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誇張了，我不過是幫襯著林先生你做了些小事。沒有我，這局面照樣也能收拾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這話你說錯了，要是沒有你，收拾出來的局面還真未必比現在好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，林先生，我自己幾斤幾兩，我自己最清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾棵筍品相上佳，你打算怎麼燒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡簡單單做個油燜筍就夠鮮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼平實的燒法未免有些浪費，照我看，不如再提上一隻現殺的羽獸回家燉湯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，那吃的可就不是筍的鮮甜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生不妨直說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，何況這幾棵筍原本長在鄉野，自有一種任心恣意的性情，想必也不願意給其他食材作配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"怕就怕筍子生得太好，就算長在深山老林，也要引得挖筍人一波一波地來挖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"如此一來，哪還能過上安然自得的日子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那都是後話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"魏老二可不會無緣無故地上別人家作客......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有自信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼自信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自信......一旦魏大人拿起筷子，就不會停下嘴來和我多說一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......老闆，你這裡有蘋果嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"有有有，林先生您拿好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不收您的錢，這些年多虧了您，大家才能安穩過日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"做生意不容易，收著吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生不是說不買東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"來都來了，給女兒帶些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，有了家室的人，到底是不一樣。本來還想明年邀你一起去姜齊遊湖賞花，看來是要作罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是早些成家，不要到處漂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，安頓下來過日子不是我所求。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人您看，這是當季的青梅，皮薄肉厚核小，味道酸中帶甘，吃了口舌生津。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"您現在要是不秤個幾斤回家泡酒，等清明過去了，這滋味就再享受不到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"行......給我秤一點吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"好好，有道是“青梅煮酒鬥時新”......哈，沒什麼文化，就光記得這麼一句。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老蔡，老遠就聽到你哄著客人掏腰包，你這嘴啊......越來越滑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，做生意嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生是這裡的常客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，夫人今天怎麼想到光顧這裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"這是龍門最大，也是貨物最齊全的菜市場。我想，買食材的話，這裡自然是不二之選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事需要夫人親自來採買食材？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，彥吾幾天後要過生日，我想下廚為他做幾道菜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人想做什麼菜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......還沒有想好，無非是彥吾常吃的那幾道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏大人愛吃的那幾樣......可能有些考驗夫人的廚藝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，我想......有心不怕費功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......我第一次來菜市場，確實不知道怎麼挑，勞煩鯉先生略施援手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，就比如說這番茄，要是拿它當水果生吃，就買粉紅色的，吃著口感略脆；要是炒菜，就選深紅色的，味道濃厚，也容易出汁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我記住了。那邊有芋頭，我想買一些做芋泥煙肉脯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芋頭啊，如果個頭差不多的話，就買重一些的那個，水多澱粉也多，吃起來軟糯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"好。那香菇呢，我該買乾的，還是新鮮的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各有各的好，看夫人要做什麼菜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"仔薑鮮肉釀香菇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要用乾香菇，泡發之後香味更足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，往前走還有一家賣豉油的店，正好買來製成豉油汁燒羽獸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是那家最近漲價了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（老蔡，這你就多慮了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"做玫瑰豉油汁嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生弄錯了，彥吾是常吃這道菜，但其實是因為我喜歡，所以才跟著一起吃了多年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前聽魏大人在飯桌上說起過。我想，因為夫人喜歡，所以魏大人愛屋及烏，倒也不稀奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗嗤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得鯉先生的嘴，比生意人還要滑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，要說生意人，最近我還真算得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是一向逍遙自在的嗎？當初彥吾多次請你出任近衛局要職，你都拒絕了。怎麼也開始愁起生計了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家裡又添了一張嘴，幫人跑跑腿多賺幾個飯錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你終於要成家了？改天我和彥吾必攜禮登門拜訪貴夫人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡的事......是一個老友遠遊去了，丟下一個孩子孤零零的，我就接過來住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"真是不負責......他有說自己什麼時候回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有......但總不可能真的丟下孩子不管吧。估計幫他看顧幾個月，他就回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等把孩子交還給他，我也打算學學他，遠遊去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好是好，可我是個浪蕩人，一個地方再好也待不久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，多謝鯉先生的指點，東西採買得差不多，我也該回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人慢走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生，哎，鯉先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......蔡老闆，找我有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生你站這裡半天了，別人還要買菜呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不好意思，咳咳。你這進口櫻桃怎麼賣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生不是嫌貴，從來不買嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，小丫頭愛吃，買幾斤回家嚐嚐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老蔡，我上周在你這裡定的那批食材到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"到了到了，就等你過來取了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不好意思，今天家裡有點事情，讓你久等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不打緊不打緊，這才九點不到，天還沒黑，離關門還早呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，今天怎麼是你來？沒讓手下那個大個子學徒來跑腿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他今天有活做，剛剛搬了新屋，他得帶著槐琥和阿打掃整理房間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"搬新屋？怎麼，原來的房子住不自在啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"房間太少了，招待客戶不方便。廚房也太小，我還想再在裡面放一個冰櫃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個冰箱還不夠啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好多人一起吃飯哪。幸好吽也算學出來了，能幫忙一起掌勺，不然燒飯都要累死人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，你這一身本事啊，別的沒人學都不可惜，唯獨這廚藝，可萬萬不能失傳。有他在，我也是放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他啊，才學了個皮毛，還差些火候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"那今天你是打算親自開伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，他們忙了一天，也是該犒勞犒勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那這一盆金桔你端走吧，就當我祝你的事務所開業大吉，發大財。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，這盆金桔我記得擺在店裡可有好幾年了，你不是一向寶貝得很，別人輕易都碰不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這寒露剛過，才結滿了果，怎麼......今天說送就送給我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"老鯉啊，不瞞你說，這菜店我不打算開下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要遷址了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我該退休啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是有十幾年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"算上從前你沒來的日子，快有三十年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"上個月通知傳過來，說這裡明年會拆掉，要改建成大型超市，雖說店鋪到時可以保留下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門這幾年......拆掉的地方未免有些太多了，家附近的茶樓也拆了，說要改成咖啡店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"就是啊。算了，我們夫妻倆操勞這麼多年，正好停下來休息休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況你一雙兒女也都長大，各自成家離開，繼續守著這家店也沒有什麼意思，不如到處走走，四處看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"在龍門這麼多年，我們還從來沒有去過大炎的其他城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年存下的積蓄再加上政府補償的拆遷費，也夠我們好好玩上幾年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"老鯉啊，你去過的地方那麼多，有沒有什麼推薦啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在龍門待了這麼多年，突然讓我回憶當時雲遊四方的經歷，也確實難說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過細細想來，不好的那些都已經是過眼雲煙，記不清晰，留下來的啊......多是當地宜人的風光和溫暖的人情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"還有吵鬧的菜市場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈......你還記得那些話啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"等我去了尚蜀，一定第一時間去那徹夜不打烊的菜市場看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年，回回看見你，你都說要離開龍門，結果十幾年過去了，走的卻是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，陰差陽錯，每每要離開，每每都有事絆住了腳步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......老蔡，許多人臨行前，都要來我這裡算上一卦，卜卜吉凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年的朋友，今天我就免費給算算，你這一路到底是個什麼光景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此卦乃世旺卦，屬大吉之相，這一路上必然身體康健，往來平安，事事順遂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，你講話總是這麼好聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老蔡啊，這可不是好聽話，是我真心所願。往後......我們有緣再見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜販","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......有緣再見了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g15_supermarket"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"超市廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快入冬了快入冬了，超市大酬賓，新鮮肉類買一送一。快入冬了快入冬了，超市大酬賓，新鮮肉類買......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"排了這麼久，吽哥，到底還要多久才能排到我們啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等，今天超市大酬賓，人肯定是多些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就為了一塊腿肉，站得人腿都麻了。我練武時站樁都沒有這麼累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾天前鯉先生特意點了蔥油燴腿肉，說要在生日的時候吃，正好今天超市里有新鮮現宰的，過幾天再買就只有冷凍貨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年紀一把，他反而越來越像小孩了，想吃什麼，片刻都不能等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生日就是滿足心願的日子嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你嘴上這麼說，不還是早早就買好了生日禮物藏在房間裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......怎麼知道的？都說我的房間不用你打掃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒進你的房間......是丟垃圾的時候看到了一大袋子的包裝紙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我也沒想到包個禮物有那麼難，拆了包，包了拆，好不容易才折平整。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"超市員工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來塊腿肉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"超市員工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前腿後腿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"槐琥，你有看到阿嗎？怎麼還沒回來？一會拿了腿肉我們就要結帳回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道啊，一進超市門他就跑得沒影了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（四處打量）嘖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了，那不就是他，正朝我們這邊走呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是跑去買什麼了，這麼久都不見人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，就是到處逛了逛，看看有什麼能買給老鯉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼也沒看中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，沒有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收銀員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好，先生，一共四百七十一龍門幣，現金還是刷卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘......這是不是算錯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收銀員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢？都是機器算的帳，不會錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪，怎麼比我算的還要多？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"槐琥，你把手提袋打開，我再點點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吽哥，別計較了，或許就是你算錯了，趕緊提著東西回家吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊對啊，出來一整天了，我看槐琥姐簡直累得筋疲力盡，還是趕緊回家休息吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽&槐琥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......槐琥，把袋子給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......給，吽哥，你可得仔細看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哎呀，多話了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腿肉、白蘿蔔、南瓜、蓮藕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，吽哥，袋子最底下好像有一個藥材包。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿——阿嚏！咳咳咳......好刺鼻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳，呸呸，這是什麼東西？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不怪我，是你們非要拿出來看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是覺得，你們給老鯉送的東西，嘖，都太沒勁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們隨後跟上來，我就先走啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......你、你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個混小子，給我回來！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["文月"]}]}
